comment
Randomization
* One of the coolest things about Satie is that you can randomize almost everything
* Use 'to' to make a range (e.g. pitch 0.1to1.5) 
endcomment

oneshot piano/1to20 every 1to5
    start 1to5
    volume .2to.5
    pitch .5to1.5
    move x -10to10 y 0to10 z -5to5 speed 1to5
    visual sphere
